{"timestamp":1774471783795,"source_app":"agentic-harness","session_id":"0993a886-a858-4417-a878-7f6407a653cc","hook_event_type":"PostToolUse","tool_name":"Read","tool_use_id":"toolu_01GY8o2aKZFufiB8xWx8yhrD","payload":{"session_id":"0993a886-a858-4417-a878-7f6407a653cc","transcript_path":"/Users/rivero/.claude/projects/-Users-rivero-ai-agentic-experience-apps-mas-trees-364bf7de-mas/0993a886-a858-4417-a878-7f6407a653cc.jsonl","cwd":"/Users/rivero/ai/agentic-experience/apps/mas/trees/364bf7de/mas","permission_mode":"bypassPermissions","hook_event_name":"PostToolUse","tool_name":"Read","tool_input":{"file_path":"/Users/rivero/ai/agentic-experience/apps/mas/trees/364bf7de/mas/specs/issue-3-adw-364bf7de-sdlc_planner-fix-aria-roles-missing-labels.md"},"tool_response":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/rivero/ai/agentic-experience/apps/mas/trees/364bf7de/mas/specs/issue-3-adw-364bf7de-sdlc_planner-fix-aria-roles-missing-labels.md","content":"# Plan: Fix Accessibility Issues \u2014 ARIA Roles and Missing aria-labels\n\n## Bug Description\n\nThree axe violations on `/products/catalog.html`:\n\n1. **aria-required-children** \u2014 `<div role=\"list\">` inside `sp-sidenav`'s shadow DOM renders with a named slot (`descendant`) but axe sees no `role=\"listitem\"` children when scanning the shadow tree, because `sp-sidenav-item` sets `role=\"listitem\"` dynamically in `firstUpdated` and its slot assignment happens in `update()`.\n\n2. **aria-required-parent** \u2014 `sp-sidenav-item[role=\"listitem\"]` elements are not structurally inside `role=\"list\"` from axe's flat-tree perspective when `merch-sidenav-list` wraps `sp-sidenav` in a `<div aria-label>` without a role, disrupting the landmark/list hierarchy.\n\n3. **Missing aria-label** \u2014 The Special Offers `sp-sidenav-item` in the Resources section has `href` and `target=\"_blank\"` but no `aria-label`. Screen readers cannot communicate that the link opens in a new tab.\n\n## Root Cause\n\n### Issue 1 & 2 \u2014 ARIA role hierarchy\n\n`merch-sidenav-list.js` `render()` wraps all content in a plain `<div aria-label=\"${this.label}\">`. A `<div>` with `aria-label` but no `role` is not a valid ARIA landmark and can confuse axe's flat-tree traversal across shadow boundaries. The `sp-sidenav` inside renders its own `<nav aria-label>` \u2014 but the outer `<div aria-label>` on the shadow host creates a redundant, role-less labeled container.\n\nAdditionally, `merch-sidenav-checkbox-group.js` `render()` has the same pattern: `<div aria-label=\"${this.label}\">` with no `role`.\n\n### Issue 3 \u2014 Missing aria-label on Special Offers link\n\nIn both test/demo pages that feed the catalog page template, the `sp-sidenav-item` for Special Offers has no `aria-label`:\n\n- `web-components/test/merch-card-collection.test.html` lines 144\u2013153\n- `web-components/test/sidenav/catalog-sidenav.test.html` lines 96\u2013102\n\n`SidenavItem.dev.js` forwards the host's `aria-label` to the inner `<a id=\"item-link\">` anchor via `LikeAnchor` mixin, so setting `aria-label` on `sp-sidenav-item` fixes the link's accessible name.\n\n## Relevant Files\n\n| File | Action |\n|---|---|\n| `web-components/src/sidenav/merch-sidenav-list.js` | Add `role=\"group\"` to the wrapper `<div aria-label>` |\n| `web-components/src/sidenav/merch-sidenav-checkbox-group.js` | Add `role=\"group\"` to the wrapper `<div aria-label>` |\n| `web-components/test/merch-card-collection.test.html` | Add `aria-label` to Special Offers `sp-sidenav-item` |\n| `web-components/test/sidenav/catalog-sidenav.test.html` | Add `aria-label` to Special Offers `sp-sidenav-item` |\n\n## Step by Step Tasks\n\n### 1. Fix `merch-sidenav-list.js` wrapper div ARIA role\n\nIn `web-components/src/sidenav/merch-sidenav-list.js`, `render()` at line 227:\n\n**Before:**\n```js\nreturn html`<div\n    aria-label=\"${this.label}\"\n    @change=\"${(e) => this.selectionChanged(e)}\"\n>\n```\n\n**After:**\n```js\nreturn html`<div\n    role=\"group\"\n    aria-label=\"${this.label}\"\n    @change=\"${(e) => this.selectionChanged(e)}\"\n>\n```\n\n`role=\"group\"` is the correct ARIA role for a generic grouping container that has an accessible label. This fixes `aria-required-parent` by providing a valid labeled container that does not conflict with the `sp-sidenav` nav/list hierarchy inside.\n\n### 2. Fix `merch-sidenav-checkbox-group.js` wrapper div ARIA role\n\nIn `web-components/src/sidenav/merch-sidenav-checkbox-group.js`, `render()` at line 99:\n\n**Before:**\n```js\nreturn html`<div aria-label=\"${this.label}\">\n```\n\n**After:**\n```js\nreturn html`<div role=\"group\" aria-label=\"${this.label}\">\n```\n\nSame pattern as above \u2014 the checkbox group already sets `role=\"group\"` and `aria-labelledby` on the host element in `addGroupTitle()`, but the shadow DOM `<div aria-label>` without role still needs the role added for axe compliance.\n\n### 3. Add `aria-label` to Special Offers `sp-sidenav-item` in `merch-card-collection.test.html`\n\nIn `web-components/test/merch-card-collection.test.html`, lines 144\u2013153:\n\n**Before:**\n```html\n<sp-sidenav-item\n    href=\"https://www.adobe.com/products/special-offers.html\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n>\n```\n\n**After:**\n```html\n<sp-sidenav-item\n    href=\"https://www.adobe.com/products/special-offers.html\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    aria-label=\"Open the Special Offers page in a new tab\"\n>\n```\n\n### 4. Add `aria-label` to Special Offers `sp-sidenav-item` in `catalog-sidenav.test.html`\n\nIn `web-components/test/sidenav/catalog-sidenav.test.html`, lines 96\u2013102:\n\n**Before:**\n```html\n<sp-sidenav-item href=\"/products/special-offers.html\">\n```\n\n**After:**\n```html\n<sp-sidenav-item\n    href=\"/products/special-offers.html\"\n    aria-label=\"Open the Special Offers page in a new tab\"\n>\n```\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] `merch-sidenav-list` shadow DOM wrapper `<div>` has `role=\"group\"` \u2014 axe `aria-required-parent` no longer fires for `sp-sidenav-item[role=\"listitem\"]`\n- [ ] `merch-sidenav-checkbox-group` shadow DOM wrapper `<div>` has `role=\"group\"` \u2014 consistent with its host-level group semantics\n- [ ] Special Offers `sp-sidenav-item` in `merch-card-collection.test.html` has `aria-label=\"Open the Special Offers page in a new tab\"`\n- [ ] Special Offers `sp-sidenav-item` in `catalog-sidenav.test.html` has `aria-label=\"Open the Special Offers page in a new tab\"`\n- [ ] No new axe violations introduced on the page\n\n## Validation Commands\n\n```\nnode --check web-components/src/sidenav/merch-sidenav-list.js\nnode --check web-components/src/sidenav/merch-sidenav-checkbox-group.js\n```\n","numLines":132,"startLine":1,"totalLines":132}},"tool_use_id":"toolu_01GY8o2aKZFufiB8xWx8yhrD"}}
